---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<main class="case-study-container">
		<a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Portfolio</a>
		
		<header class="case-header">
			<span class="badge">Final Year Project</span>
			<h1>CampusNotify</h1>
			<p class="subtitle">Centralized campus communication ecosystem featuring real-time announcements, event management, and role-based workflows.</p>
		</header>

		<section class="content-section">
			<h2>The Problem & Solution</h2>
			<p>Students traditionally receive fragmented campus information via social media groups, messaging apps, and physical notice boards. CampusNotify aggregates these communications into a single, structured Android application complete with authentication and a scalable architecture.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="content-section">
			<h2>Architecture & Tech Stack</h2>
			<div class="grid-2">
				<div class="card">
					<h3>Architecture</h3>
					<p>Built using <strong>Clean Architecture + MVVM</strong>. Separates presentation, domain, and data layers to maintain clean boundaries and high testability.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="card">
					<h3>Tech Stack</h3>
					<p>Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Hilt (Dependency Injection), Firebase Authentication, Cloud Firestore, Coroutines & Flow.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="content-section">
			<h2>Key Features</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Secure Authentication:</strong> Complete Firebase Auth flow with email/password, password recovery, and Google Sign-In.</li>
				<li><strong>Role-Based Dashboards:</strong> Structured flows separating student updates from administrative management.</li>
				<li><strong>Reactive UI State:</strong> Built entirely with Jetpack Compose for smooth, predictable interfaces.</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	body {
		background-color: #090d16;
		color: #f1f5f9;
		font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
	}
	.case-study-container {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 4rem 2rem;
	}
	.back-link {
		color: #38bdf8;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 600;
		display: inline-block;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}
	.case-header h1 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		color: #ffffff;
		margin: 0.5rem 0;
	}
	.subtitle {
		color: #94a3b8;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
	}
	.content-section {
		margin-top: 3rem;
	}
	.content-section h2 {
		color: #38bdf8;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b;
		padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}
	.grid-2 {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}
	.card {
		background: #111827;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		border: 1px solid #1f2937;
	}
	ul {
		color: #94a3b8;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	ul strong {
		color: #f1f5f9;
	}
</style>